 <h3><u>Khuda khayr kare</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Alamdar alamdar alamdar..(5)<br> Jab hui der alamdar ko darya pe gaye..(2)<br> ashke ghum zainab e dilgeer ki ankho se gire<br> boli ye zainab e lachaar..khuda khair kare<br> dekhiye sayyade abraar...khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar<br> dekho darya ki taraf mauje darya ki taraf<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar khuda khair kare</p> 
  <p>1. Haan yahi kehke sakina se gaya tha ghaazi<br> izn baba se dila do to mai laau pani..(2)<br> legaya mashk wafadaar..khuda khair kare<br> wo hai paani ki talabgaar..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
  <p>2. Sukhe kooze liye hatho me khade hai pyase<br> ab to aa jana tha ghaazi ko mere darya se..(2)<br> hogaye pyaase dilafgaar..khuda khair kare<br> jaa balab jeene se bezaar..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
  <p>3. Raasta mere alamdaar ka takte hai sabhi<br> hai koi mehwe dua koi padhe naade ali..(2)<br> keh raha hai dile ghumkhwaar..khuda khair kare<br> alqama par hai sitamgaar..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
  <p>4.&nbsp; Paasba khaima e shabbir ka ab koi nahi<br> aasra zainab e dilgeer ka ab koi nahi..(2)<br> roke kehta hai dile zaar..khuda khair kare<br> wo hai chadar ka nigehbaan..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
  <p>5. Sunke zainab ki sada ran ko chale shaahe hoda<br> thokre khate kamar thaame hue mehwe buka..(2)<br> boli kulsoom dilafgaaar..khuda khair kare<br> kaun hai sheh ka madadgaar..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
  <p>6. Khoon me dooba alam aaya jo zainab ko nazar<br> apne nazdeek sakina ko bulaya rokar..(2)<br> phir ye kehne lagi lachaar..khuda khair kare<br> ab nahi kehna dilafgaar..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
  <p>7. Shor e ghum mazhar o irfan qayamat ka utha<br> jab alam aaya to shabbir se zainab ne kaha..(2)<br> kuch batao mere ghumkhwaar..khuda khair kare<br> jab alam aaya hai sarkaar..khuda khair kare<br> kyu nahi aaya alamdaar..</p> 
